NNOOTTEESS
       If any of the modify attributes or the modify mask are invalid, none of
       the attributes will be modified (including the QP state).

       Not all devices support resizing QPs.  To check if  a  device  supports
       it,  check if the IIBBVV__DDEEVVIICCEE__RREESSIIZZEE__MMAAXX__WWRR bit is set in the device ca‐
       pabilities flags.

       Not all devices support alternate paths.  To check if a device supports
       it,  check if the IIBBVV__DDEEVVIICCEE__AAUUTTOO__PPAATTHH__MMIIGG bit is set in the device ca‐
       pabilities flags.

